  message: "Implemented in di_resolution.py linker. Supports Guice bind().to(), Spring @Bean, C# AddScoped/AddTransient/AddSingleton, NestJS/Angular/Inversify providers, Python injector, Kotlin Koin, Java SPI META-INF/services. Resolution cascade: explicit (0.90) > SPI (0.85) > naming convention (0.75) > single-impl (0.70). Creates di_resolves edges (non-structural, followed by forward BFS). 35 tests, 100% coverage."  # ae5c
